        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 943S, Jacksonville Solid Brass Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jacksonville Lever with Square Rose is one of Omnia's most popular designs. Its modern look makes it a great choice for remodels. It is available as a dummy, passage, or privacy function in modern finishes including polished chrome and satin nickel. This  Jacksonville Solid Brass Lever with Square Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-75028-SM.jpg?v=1704354609\" width=\"377\" height=\"198\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia #943S specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/jacksonville-lever-with-round-rose-omnia-943-00\"><b>Jacksonville Lever with Round Rose</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Jacksonville Lever with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 943S Contemporary Jacksonville Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-9/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\", 1-3/4\", or 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>28 degrees rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard 2-1/8\" inch door bore.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw rose.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on one side of the door. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Stationery door lever on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 rosettes, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, solid spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, slit spindle, and mounting screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Jacksonville Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Jacksonville Lever with Square Rose is one of Omnia's most popular designs. Its modern look makes it a great choice for remodels. It is available as a dummy, passage, or privacy function in modern finishes including polished chrome and satin nickel. This  Jacksonville Solid Brass Lever with Square Rose will fit 1-3/8 inch, 1-3/4 inch, or 2 inch thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
